              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="iitj-assist_item">
              <div class="iitj-icon-48">
                <img
                  src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/687e11ae076e4c47d227af38/6adbca5557ccb3a7ad5536ba_iitj-de-assist-mocks.svg"
                  alt=""
                  class="iitj-img-contain"
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="text-size-medium iitj-weight-semibold iitj-text-ink">
                Mocks
              </div>
              <p class="iitj-text-grey">
                Mock interviews with mentors and FLC members
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="iitj-assist_item">
